<h3 id="making-the-bird-jump"><a href="{{page.url}}#making-the-bird-jump">Making the Bird Jump</a></h3>

<p>To make it jump is very simple actually, we just need to set <code>Velocity.Y</code> in some moment, in this case, when some key from the keyboard is pressed:</p>

<pre>
public class Bird {
    ...
    public float Gravity = 0.25f; // changed
    public float JumpImpulse = 4f;
    ...
    public void Update()
    {
        ...

        if (KeyboardExtended.IsKeyJustPressed(Keys.Space))
        {
            Velocity.Y = -JumpImpulse;
        }

        Position += Velocity;
    }
}
</pre>

<video src="/assets/flappy_bird_course/videos/bird_is_jumping.mp4" autoplay muted loop></video>

