<h3 id="reseting"><a href="{{page.url}}#reseting">Reseting</a></h3>

<p>Now we need to reset our game by removing the pipes created during the game and reseting the bird's position:</p>

<pre>
public class Bird {
    ...
    public void Reset()
    {
        Velocity = Vector2.Zero;
        _isCollidingWithPipe = false;
    }
}
</pre>

<pre>
public class Game1 : Game {
    ...
    protected override void Update(GameTime gameTime)
    {
        ...
        if (_start)
        {
            ...
            if (!_gameOver)
                _bird.Update(_pipes);

            <strong>if (_gameOver)
            {
                if (KeyboardExtended.IsKeyJustPressed(Keys.Space)) 
                    Reset();
            }</strong>
        }
        ...
    }
    ...
    private void Reset()
    {
        _bird.Reset();
        _bird.Position = _birdInitialPosition;

        _pipes.Clear();
        _scroll = false;
        _start = false;
        _gameOver = false;
        _pipesSpawnElapsed = 0f;
    }
}
</pre>

<p>Realize that the code snippet that resets our game is placed <strong>after</strong> the part that updates the bird, this is necessary to avoid that right after pressing space to reset the game it begans immeditely.</p>

